+  unfold dihXf
+  rw [p25w_atn2_eq_arctan hA]
+  rw [show (-deltaX4 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 / Real.sqrt (4 * x1 * deltaX x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6))
+      = -(deltaX4 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 / Real.sqrt (4 * x1 * deltaX x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6)) from
